  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "By default, Notification also affects the transparency of the text.\nHowever, if even the text is given transparency, it cannot be read properly.\nThis weakness in readability is fatal, since the text in notifications is long and it takes time to decipher what has happened.\nAs a sample, three assumed patterns are given as images.\nThis sample notificaiton is colored for friends and joins to convey why it is valid to color different topics.",
